# Stage 4 bench tools (docs/manual-aim.md, stage 4): who shot, the dice and the damage in the log, the seed,
# volleys with a random hold, an npc's stats and talent animations, archers set out on an arc, a fight with
# them, waiting till the hero falls
cheat god
set time 12 0
view clean
goto NW_TROLLAREA_PATH_23
wait 500
clear 3000
equip ItRw_Bow_L_01
give ItRw_Arrow 200
stats str 60 dex 60 bow 60 talent auto
insert BAU_904_BAUER
wait 300
immortal BAU_904_BAUER on
pin BAU_904_BAUER 1000 0 0
aimat BAU_904_BAUER body
zones BAU_904_BAUER
tap bow
wait 1500

# the same seed twice: the same arrows; another: other ones
seed 7
rec seed7a novideo
volley 5 300 1 300
stop
seed 7
rec seed7b novideo
volley 5 300 1 300
stop
seed 8
rec seed8 novideo
volley 5 300 1 300
stop
tap parade
wait 1000

# a bandit archer, its talent animations, a fight at 13 m: dice shots, damage under god mode
npcaim off
pin off
clear 3000
arc BDT_1003_BANDIT_M 1 1300 0
wait 300
stats npc BDT_1003_BANDIT_M talent auto
immortal player on
still player on
fight all player
cam follow 600 200 120
rec fight novideo
wait 20000
stop

# the hero mortal, weak: the fight ends
cheat god
immortal player off
stats hp 80 hpmax 80
rec down
waitdown player 60000
stop
